# A profile written by `--profile-capture` opened in the editor's Profiler
# (ADR 0210): the panel opened from the command palette, the file's path typed
# into the bar's field, Open pressed. `<capture>` is the file the gate wrote
# a moment before. Coordinates are a 1600 by 900 frame's.
wait 60
key ctrl+shift+p
wait 8
text Profiler
wait 8
key enter
wait 20
drag 700 607 700 330
wait 10
click 800 373
wait 4
text <capture>
wait 4
click 1160 373
move 700 200
wait 10
shot capture-open
click 165 373
move 700 200
wait 6
shot capture-worst
quit
